' Style shared by the class diagrams of the client (client-0*.puml). Each box is a React component,
' a hook or an ES module of src/, not a class: its members are the props and the functions of it the
' feature uses. Packages: "Pages" (src/pages), "Components" (src/features/*/components and
' src/components), "State" (the session, the profile chosen, what is kept in the browser), "API" (the
' *Api.js modules, one fetch each). The server is <<external>>, its routes listed on it.
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9B458
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #555555
    ArrowColor #555555
}
skinparam class<<other feature>> {
    BackgroundColor #EEF3FA
    BorderColor #7A93B8
}
skinparam class<<external>> {
    BackgroundColor #F2F2F2
    BorderColor #888888
}
hide circle
hide empty members
